  "description": "Download Ultimate Custom Night effortlessly at no cost. Completely secure, with no viruses or malware. Always access the newest version without hassle.",
  "editor_review": "Prepare yourself for the ultimate FNaF adventure with this exhilarating crossover! You will face a swarm of sinister animatronics as you find yourself isolated in an office environment. With 50 animatronic characters available from seven different Five Nights at Freddy's titles, the customization options are limitless. Adjust their difficulty levels, combine your preferred characters, and jump straight into the fray. Survival isn’t the only challenge; you’ll need to get the hang of new equipment such as heaters, air conditioning systems, and a power generator. Don't overlook the importance of establishing laser traps, gathering Faz-Coins, and monitoring the Pirate Cove curtains. With 16 themed challenges, unlockable office designs, and voice performances from both familiar faces and newcomers, this game is essential for any Five Nights at Freddy's enthusiast. Be sure not to miss this epic animatronic clash!",
  "how_to_play": [
    "Combine and personalize your favorite animatronics for a tailored gameplay experience.",
    "Utilize the available tools to endure the night, including heaters, air conditioning, and a power\n              generator.",
    "Place laser traps in the vents to defend against approaching animatronics.",
    "Collect Faz-Coins to acquire items from the Prize Counter.",
    "Monitor the Pirate Cove curtains vigilantly to avoid unexpected events."
  ],
